-up focuses on legs, hips and waist. Bobo keeps walking upward, white sleeveless shirt clinging tightly to her back, dim surrounding environment. 16:9 horizontal medium close-up, composition guides sight upward along the spine, photorealistic photography, 8K, no text, no watermarks, no overlay characters\n\n---\n\n# Frame 3｜00:25-00:27.5\n\nTracking close-up shot from rear view. Upper body close-up focuses on waist, back and the back of the head. Bobo continues walking upward, white sleeveless shirt clinging tightly to her back. Narrow overhead light creates distinct light-shadow division across her back, dim surroundings. 16:9 horizontal medium close-up, composition guides sight upward along the spine, photorealistic photography, 8K, no text, no watermarks, no overlay characters\n\n---\n\n# Frame 4｜00:27.5-00:30\n\nBobo reaches out and pushes open the iron rooftop gate. Blinding intense white light bursts out and surges outward from the door crack. Her back silhouette is half shrouded by strong light, dense halo forms along the edge of her outline. Large areas of the frame are overexposed, only the pushing arm and body silhouette can be distinguished, delivering powerful visual impact. 16:9 horizontal medium shot, highlights dominate the whole frame, photorealistic photography, 8K, no text, no watermarks, no overlay characters\n\n---\n\n# 2×2 Four-Panel Storyboard Master Prompt — G03\n\nCreate professional ultra HD 2×2 four-panel storyboard, horizontal layout, pure black background, panels separated by dark grey dividing lines. The overall style carries dramatic tension transitioning from darkness to blazing strong light. All four frames feature the character Bobo captured from rear view, consistent outfit, continuous and unified cold-toned stairwell lighting. Every panel strictly adopts a 16:9 aspect ratio, mark labels at the bottom-right of each panel: G03-1, G03-2, G03-3, G03-4.\n\nTop left G03-1: Tracking shot from rear view, heel lifting off stair, clearly showing contour of the back of legs.\nTop right G03-2: Tracking close-up from rear view focusing on legs, hips and waist, showcasing hip lines.\nBottom left G03-3: Tracking close-up from rear view, capturing the character’s upper body.\nBottom right G03-4: The moment of pushing the gate, overexposed white light bursts from door crack and engulfs the character’s back silhouette.\n\nThe character’s continuous upward movement remains smooth and coherent across all panels. Lighting achieves a dramatic shift from darkness to extreme brightness. No subtitles, watermarks, timecodes or any redundant text are allowed on the image, photorealistic photography, 8K"], "inputs": [{"widget": {"name": "text"}, "name": "text", "label": "text", "type": "STRING", "localized_name": "text"}], "flags": {}, "id": 12, "type": "Text", "title": "提示词", "properties": {"widget_ue_connectable": {}, "Node name for S&R": "Text"}, "order": 5}], "extra": {"links_added_by_ue": [], "ue_links": [], "0246.VERSION": [0, 0, 4], "ds": {"offset": [1490.2313452826606, -1813.5915586683486], "scale": 0.45}}, "groups": [{"color": "#3f789e", "font_size": 24, "flags": {}, "id": 1, "title": "NanoBannana2 - 文生图", "bounding": [602.1000366210938, 212.70001220703125, 1587, 582.5999755859375]}, {"color": "#3f789e", "font_size": 24, "flags": {}, "id": 2, "title": "单图编辑", "bounding": [614.4338989257812, 883.853515625, 1660.0169677734375, 955.84130859375]}, {"color": "#3f789e", "font_size": 24, "flags": {}, "id": 3, "title": "双图编辑", "bounding": [229.4708709716797, 1844.8104248046875, 2080.630859375, 956.5064697265625]}], "links": [[1, 3, 0, 2, 10, "STRING"], [2, 2, 0, 4, 0, "IMAGE"], [3, 6, 0, 5, 0, "IMAGE"], [4, 5, 0, 8, 0, "IMAGE"], [5, 7, 0, 5, 10, "STRING"], [6, 9, 0, 10, 0, "IMAGE"], [7, 12, 0, 10, 10, "STRING"], [8, 10, 0, 11, 0, "IMAGE"], [9, 13, 0, 10, 1, "IMAGE"]], "id": "07a36d46-0631-49ca-bc31-dc1e6ce9c06b", "config": {}, "version": 0.4, "last_node_id": 14, "revision": 0}